	('Thank you','Cảm ơn','00:05:49.330','00:05:49.970','english-fairy-tales-61'),
	('Thank you','Cảm ơn','00:05:50.230','00:05:50.930','english-fairy-tales-61'),
	('Thank you','Cảm ơn','00:05:51.170','00:05:51.810','english-fairy-tales-61'),
	('I won\'t let you down','Tôi sẽ không làm bạn thất vọng','00:05:52.170','00:05:53.510','english-fairy-tales-61'),
	('I love to look at the stars','Tôi thích ngắm những vì sao','00:06:26.350','00:06:28.430','english-fairy-tales-61'),
	('Should we go on a little walk?','Chúng ta có nên đi dạo một chút không?','00:06:28.970','00:06:30.370','english-fairy-tales-61'),
