	('I felt my cheeks heat up, but I still managed to answer','Tôi cảm thấy má mình nóng lên, nhưng vẫn kịp trả lời','00:12:16.300','00:12:19.960','life-diary-animated-33'),
	('I also quite enjoy swimming','Tôi cũng khá thích bơi lội','00:12:20.840','00:12:22.480','life-diary-animated-33'),
	('Thank you, I will apply to join','Cảm ơn bạn, tôi sẽ đăng ký tham gia','00:12:23.080','00:12:25.000','life-diary-animated-33'),
	('Antonio then turned to smack the recruit\'s hand','Sau đó Antonio quay lại vỗ tay người tuyển dụng','00:12:26.360','00:12:29.100','life-diary-animated-33'),
	('The two of them seemed extremely close','Hai người họ có vẻ rất thân thiết','00:12:29.660','00:12:31.740','life-diary-animated-33'),
